			"notes": "# More Darkness 2.0.0\n\nNew: the mod now simulates the human eye.\n\n- **Eye adaptation** (`eyeAdaptation`, on by default): eyes slowly adapt to darkness and reveal your close surroundings only; distant darkness stays black. Vision turns colorless in the dark. Leaving darkness abruptly is blinding for a moment.\n- **Darker water** (`darkerWater`, on by default): water is murky, above and below the surface. Swamps hide everything, warm oceans stay clear.\n- Smoother light falloff around torches, and smooth lighting on water surfaces.\n- Fixed Distant Horizons LOD chunks flickering between light levels."
		},
